1
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:59,240
Tang Zhiluo.

2
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,600
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

3
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,280
Tang Zhiluo.

4
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,040
I don't know why

5
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,840
you appeared again.

6
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,800
Since I have found you,

7
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,240
I won't allow you to be in any danger.

8
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,079
My Lord,

9
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:59,440
could you inform me earlier next time you venture into the tiger's den alone?

10
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,900
If I hadn't arrived in time

11
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,600
and you had died there,

12
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,960
the Crown Prince's investiture next month would be canceled,

13
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:09,160
saving the Ministry of Revenue some silver.

14
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,960
Are you that eager to find another job?

15
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,850
You want to get rid of me?

16
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,200
In your dreams.

17
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,480
I was impulsive.

18
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,800
You always die and are reborn.

19
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,940
How many times has it been?

20
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,680
You must have forgotten everything again.

21
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:43,840
No matter how many times you go through the cycle of life and death,

22
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,600
you must return to my side.

23
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,240
Tang Zhiluo.

24
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,200
Did you hear me?

25
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,600
Tang Zhiluo.

26
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:24,020
The human monarch has appeared in the world.

27
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,760
You must go to his side

28
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:28,160
and fulfill your mission.

29
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,600
Protect him. Kill him.

30
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,280
Assist him. Kill him.

31
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,080
Remember, kill him.

32
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,480
Protect him.

33
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,760
Assist him.

34
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,159
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

35
00:05:38,159 --> 00:05:38,760
Protect him.

36
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,400
Kill him. Assist him.

37
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,920
Zhiluo.

38
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,200
You're awake.

39
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,159
Yuwen Jingxuan.

40
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,960
Kill him.

41
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:54,880
Kill him.

42
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,920
Kill Yuwen Jingxuan.

43
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,040
Zhiluo.

44
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,080
She must have been hit by the Soul-Destroying Nail,

45
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,680
which is why she lost her mind

46
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,340
and is acting abnormally.

47
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,280
No wonder she attacked me.

48
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:39,400
The Soul-Destroying Nail is a forbidden art of the Shang clan,

49
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:42,130
passed down only to the eldest legitimate child.

50
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:45,440
Are you really going to the Yuwen clan's forbidden area to exchange for the antidote?

51
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,360
I must go.

52
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,080
Can you not go?

53
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,200
The crown prince ceremony is imminent.

54
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:51,000
We can't fail at the last moment.

55
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:53,159
Are you saying this as a friend

56
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,600
or as an advisor?

57
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:00,680
As a friend,

58
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:03,640
I completely understand your feelings for her all these years.

59
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,640
But as an advisor,

60
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,280
I hope you don't go.

61
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,120
Don't worry.

62
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,680
Even if I die,

63
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:14,560
you and the Su family will be able to retreat safely.

64
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,560
Am I advising you for myself

65
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,560
or for my Su family?

66
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,840
You know it's a trap.

67
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,560
Su Zhiye.

68
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:22,280
You are my best friend.

69
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,800
If she wakes up,

70
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,530
help me take care of her.

71
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,000
Tell me, what do you want?

72
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,640
Anything?

73
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:02,920
Is that woman so important to you?

74
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,000
Okay.

75
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:07,160
I want your...

76
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:20,120
Miss Tang!

77
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,160
Miss Tang!

78
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,050
Are you alright, Miss Tang?

79
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,400
Miss Tang! Miss Tang!

80
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:29,920
Miss Tang!

81
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,520
Miss Tang!

82
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,480
Miss Tang! Young Master Su!

83
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:38,080
You are too cruel.

84
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:38,679
Even if you blame me,

85
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,880
there's nothing I can do.

86
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,400
If she really broke her arm,

87
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,760
Jingxuan would definitely fight me to the death.

88
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,880
Miss Tang, Miss Tang.

89
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:45,360
It's okay.

90
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,520
It's okay, Miss Tang.

91
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,520
Jingxuan.

92
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:50,480
Let me do it.

93
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:05,130
I really don't know what to do with you.

94
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,120
Who are you?

95
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,960
I am Yuwen Jingxuan.

96
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,320
Then...

97
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,760
who am I?

98
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,000
This inspection of river affairs

99
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,400
and investigation of corruption

100
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,520
have been applauded by everyone in the court and the public.

101
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,850
My father's letter said

102
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,960
Prince Yu looked very displeased,

103
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:17,290
and His Majesty was not very happy either.

104
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,880
His Majesty has always been biased.

105
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,140
Don't take it to heart.

106
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,640
I didn't expect anything anyway.

107
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,480
There are plenty of discerning people,

108
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,480
so my political achievements won't be buried.

109
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,800
Just mentioning it makes me angry for you.

110
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:30,440
He disliked the late Empress,

111
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,360
and consequently, he harshly suppresses you.

112
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:35,560
Haven't you suffered enough grievances all these years?

113
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,280
You and Prince Yu share the same roots.

114
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,680
He was born to the second empress,

115
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,840
and is beneath you.

116
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,200
You face obstacles in everything,

117
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,320
while he has smooth sailing.

118
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,760
I really can't accept this.

119
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:47,220
Even five fingers are not of the same length.

120
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,440
Pass a message to the Right Chancellor for me.

121
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,480
In the court,

122
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,250
there is no need to engage in verbal disputes.

123
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,320
Yes,

124
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,680
my Prince Shuo.

125
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,080
Someone fell into the water!

126
00:10:59,200 --> 00:10:59,840
Hey, Jingxuan!
